#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:4
msgid "How to: add a custom dataset"
msgstr "操作指南：添加自定义数据集"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:6
msgid ""
"A federated dataset in fl-sim combines two components: the **raw data** and a **partitioning scheme** that spreads it across the simulated clients. This guide covers the complete example in ``test-"
"files/custom_dataset.py`` (a re-implementation of the FedProx paper's FEMNIST variant, exercised in CI via ``test-files/custom_conf.yml``) and then derives a minimal template starting from NumPy "
"arrays."
msgstr "fl-sim 中的联邦数据集由两部分组成： **原始数据** 与把它分散到各模拟客户端的 **划分方案** 。本指南先走完 ``test-files/custom_dataset.py`` 的完整示例（FedProx 论文所用 FEMNIST 变体的复刻，经 ``test-files/custom_conf.yml`` 在 CI 中执行），再从 NumPy 数组出发给出最小模板。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:15
msgid "Choose the base class"
msgstr "选择基类"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:17
msgid ":class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_dataset.FedVisionDataset` — image data with the usual ``TensorDataset`` plumbing; what the example uses;"
msgstr ":class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_dataset.FedVisionDataset`——图像数据，带常规的 ``TensorDataset`` 管线；示例用的就是它；"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:19
msgid ":class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_dataset.FedDataset` — the fully abstract base, for anything non-vision."
msgstr ":class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_dataset.FedDataset`——完全抽象的基类，适合一切非视觉数据。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:22
msgid "The required interface is small: load data in ``_preload``, hand out dataloaders per client in ``get_dataloader``, and score predictions in ``evaluate``."
msgstr "必需接口很小：在 ``_preload`` 里加载数据，在 ``get_dataloader`` 里按客户端分发dataloader，在 ``evaluate`` 里为预测打分。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:27
msgid "The full example"
msgstr "完整示例"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:34
msgid ""
"``_preload`` runs once at construction: resolve the data directory, declare the defaults the framework queries (client counts, batch size, the file layout), set the ``criterion``, download if "
"needed, and read the raw files into memory. fl-sim datasets are **immutable after construction** — partitioning happens here, once."
msgstr "``_preload`` 在构造时只跑一次：解析数据目录、声明框架会查询的默认值（客户端数、批大小、文件布局）、设置 ``criterion``、按需下载，并把原始文件读入内存。fl-sim 数据集 **构造后不可变** ——划分就在这里做，且只做一次。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:45
msgid ""
"The contract of ``get_dataloader``: given a client index (or ``None`` for \"everything\"), return a **pair** of dataloaders ``(train, test)`` with shuffling enabled — the framework re-requests them "
"every round, and under ``rng_mode=\"per_client\"`` (:doc:`tutorial-parallel-reproducible`) their shuffling is what gets re-seeded per client."
msgstr "``get_dataloader`` 的契约：给定客户端索引（或 ``None`` 表示\"全部\"），返回一对开启洗牌的 dataloader ``(train, test)`` —— 框架每轮都会重新请求它们；在 ``rng_mode=\"per_client\"`` （ :doc:`tutorial-parallel-reproducible` ）下，被按客户端重新播种的正是这里的洗牌。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:56
msgid "``evaluate`` turns a batch of predictions and labels into the metric dictionary that lands in the logs (``acc``, ``loss``, ``num_samples``, ... — the same keys :doc:`quickstart` read back)."
msgstr "``evaluate`` 把一批预测与标签变成写进日志的指标字典（ ``acc`` 、 ``loss`` 、 ``num_samples`` 等——正是 :doc:`quickstart` 读回的那些键）。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:65
msgid ""
"The remaining properties are conventions rather than requirements: ``mirrors`` / ``url`` feed the download mechanism (fallback URLs tried in order — see the "
":meth:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_dataset.FedDataset.mirrors` API for the protocol), ``candidate_models`` declares the models that fit this data (the CLI's ``model: name:`` picks from here), "
"``label_map`` names the classes, ``doi`` carries citations."
msgstr ""
"其余 property 是惯例而非硬性要求： ``mirrors`` / ``url`` 供下载机制使用（备选 URL 按序尝试——协议见 :meth:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_dataset.FedDataset.mirrors` API）； ``candidate_models`` 声明适合本数据的模型（CLI 的 ``model: name:`` "
"从这里选取）； ``label_map`` 给类别命名； ``doi`` 携带引用。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:73
msgid "The minimal template"
msgstr "最小模板"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:75
msgid "From NumPy arrays to a usable federated dataset. The template below has been verified by end-to-end execution; three conventions it encodes are easy to miss and costly to debug:"
msgstr "从 NumPy 数组到可用的联邦数据集。下述模板已通过端到端执行验证；它编码的三个约定容易漏掉、调起来又贵："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:79
msgid ""
"**define your own ``__init__``**: the abstract :class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_dataset.FedDataset` base has no constructor of its own (the vision subclass supplies one); accept ``(datadir, "
"transform, seed, **extra_config)`` and re-seed via ``set_seed`` so every constructor re-seeds the global RNG exactly like the built-ins do;"
msgstr ""
" **自己定义 ``__init__``** ：抽象基类 :class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_dataset.FedDataset` 本身没有构造器（视觉子类提供了一个）；接受 ``(datadir, transform, seed, **extra_config)`` 并经 ``set_seed`` 重新播种，让每个构造器都和内置数据集一样重置全局 "
"RNG；"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:85
msgid "**the framework requests global loaders too**: ``get_dataloader`` must handle ``client_idx=None`` (\"all clients\"), not just per-client indices;"
msgstr " **框架也会请求全局 loader** ： ``get_dataloader`` 必须处理 ``client_idx=None`` （\"全部客户端\"），不能只处理逐客户端的索引；"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:88
msgid "**``candidate_models`` should return fl-sim models** (they carry the ``.device`` attribute the device-allocation step relies on)."
msgstr " **``candidate_models`` 应返回 fl-sim 模型** （它们带有设备分配步骤依赖的 ``.device`` 属性）。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:91
msgid "Two ``load_partition_data*`` methods appear required but are a legacy tff-style bulk-loading API that the training loop never calls — stub implementations satisfy the abstract interface:"
msgstr "两个 ``load_partition_data*`` 方法看似必需，实为训练循环从不调用的遗留 tff 风格批量加载 API——桩实现即可满足抽象接口："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:172
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-dataset.rst:174
msgid ""
"With the ``@register_fed_dataset()`` decorator applied, the dataset is constructible by name once its module has been imported (or via the module *path* as the dataset ``name`` — see "
":class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_data_args.FedDataArgs`), and every built-in works on it unchanged:"
msgstr "应用 ``@register_fed_dataset()`` 装饰器后，只要模块被导入过，数据集即可按名字构造（或以模块 *路径* 作为数据集 ``name`` ——见 :class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_data_args.FedDataArgs`），且所有内置组件原样可用："

